                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Almost all of my time was spent idling cards. I've tried to actually play this for about five minutes, which I can summarize in one word...\n\nCRASH\n\nIt crashed to desktop multiple times on the main menu alone. I finally got into the actual game, and it crashed three steps into the tutorial. I actually wanted to play this, but I'm pretty sure at this point I won't be able to. Attached my specs to the review in case yours match. If anyone knows a way around all this crashing, let me know. \n\nI got this in some sort of bundle, but I don't remember where or when. I would not recommend it because, at least on my system it's not just bad, it's straight up unplayable. Buy with caution.",
